# Gesture project context

Read root `AGENTS.md` before changing sign recognition, training, or Postgres.

- Talk uses hardcoded heuristics until the user **Promotes** a trained model.
- Add samples writes immediately to Postgres table `training_samples` (column `name` = Yes/Hello/Clear). Do not write gold holds to `samples.jsonl`.
- One thumb sideways = Undo last word. Both thumbs sideways = Clear sentence. Thumbs up = Yes. Still palm = Hello. Wave motion = Goodbye.
- Both indexes = Help. One index at camera = I. Bunched hand near mouth = Food. Pinch near chin = Water. Sideways index = Direction.
- Two hands: both peace = Understood; fist+palm = Doctor; both fists = Sick; both thumbs up = Happy; both palms = Today; both pinkies = Tomorrow. Okay stays one hand (index curled, three up).
- Signs UI stays on the left. Do not commit `backend/.env`.
